WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.360
The bad blood between the hosts of "American&nbsp;
Pickers" has been very public, but did you hear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:10.960
about one cast member's tax scandal? Keep watching&nbsp;
to find out who the IRS had in their sights.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:17.440
For over 10 years, television viewers have been&nbsp;
captivated by the wacky and crazy finds made on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:22.480
the History Channel's hit reality show "American&nbsp;
Pickers." Countless items have been discovered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:28.320
since Mike Wolfe, Frank Fritz, and Danielle&nbsp;
Colby first made their TV debuts in 2010,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:33.360
and they continue to unearth long-lost family&nbsp;
artifacts and heirlooms to this very day.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.280
Sometimes they have to delve deep into&nbsp;
a stranger's garage to find some hidden&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:40.880
treasure, but whether they locate&nbsp;
old vehicles or antique weaponry,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:45.360
they always tend to find something worth&nbsp;
a pretty penny. They're masters of sorting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:50.160
through various memorabilia, but they're not&nbsp;
the only ones who enjoy digging up the past.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:54.080
Viewers have done the research and&nbsp;
discovered a number of scandals and secrets,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:57.920
such as the controversial firing of&nbsp;
Fritz and his reported feud with Wolfe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:02.000
who is still on the show for its&nbsp;
22nd season. Fritz told The Sun,

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.240
"We were never friends in grade school. I&nbsp;
don't believe in 10 years he's said five&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:10.640
nice things to me, you know? Unless he was cutting&nbsp;
somebody else down and we were both laughing."

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:14.800
It seems like a lot of drama for a series&nbsp;
that's essentially about antiquing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:19.440
But there's one proverbial black eye on the show&nbsp;
that many fans might not know about — one which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:24.080
could have potentially landed a cast member&nbsp;
behind bars. And it's not who you think.

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:29.360
Anyone who watches "American Pickers" knows that&nbsp;
Danielle Colby isn't a person who cares too much&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:34.960
about what others think. She's practically covered&nbsp;
in head to toe with tattoos and has gained fame&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:39.760
as a burlesque dancer. She marches to the beat&nbsp;
of her own drum, and that's why fans adore her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:44.320
However, if there's one group of people&nbsp;
you don't want to upset, it's the IRS.

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:49.360
According to Radar Online, in 2013 Colby&nbsp;
reportedly received a notice from the IRS&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:55.200
saying she owed nearly $6,000 in taxes. It&nbsp;
seemed particularly odd given that Colby is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.200 --> 00:02:00.560
allegedly worth roughly $1.5 million thanks&nbsp;
to her earnings from "American Pickers."

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:05.600
The back taxes are reportedly related to the&nbsp;
reality star's burlesque boutique, dubbed "4&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:10.400
Miles 2 Memphis," which received at least four&nbsp;
notices from the feds. Documents obtained by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:16.880
Radar Online allegedly show that Colby never filed&nbsp;
any returns. In June 2014, she was slapped with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:25.040
notice of a lien for $5,936 in estimated retail&nbsp;
taxes for sales that were made in December 2013.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:26.560
"I'm really greedy with my things."

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:34.720
"My collection is primarily vintage burlesque&nbsp;
and sideshow and circus and striptease costumes."

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:39.760
There's currently no documentation online proving&nbsp;
Colby paid her taxes, but judging from the fact&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:44.080
she's not in federal prison right now, it's&nbsp;
a safe bet that she took care of it. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:47.920
the scandal might be enough to make&nbsp;
some fans worry about Colby's future&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:51.280
on "American Pickers," especially&nbsp;
in light of Frank Fritz's departure.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:55.920
Fortunately, viewers probably won't have to&nbsp;
say another goodbye any time soon. Colby is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.920 --> 00:03:00.240
still on "American Pickers" and seems to&nbsp;
enjoy continuing to work with her co-star,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:04.080
Mike Wolfe. In fact, she posted a photo&nbsp;
of the two of them together on Instagram&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:07.760
in August 2021, where she&nbsp;
spoke highly of his character.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:08.240
She wrote,

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:12.080
"Thank you for the last decade of&nbsp;
advocacy towards myself and others on set.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:16.320
@mikewolfeamericanpicker I'm proud of how&nbsp;
you have handled the last 12 years and look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:20.160
forward to many more years of rolling&nbsp;
around this big blue marble together."

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:24.000
She's been thorough in her efforts to let&nbsp;
the world know that she and Mike Wolfe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:28.400
are still on good terms. During the Fritz&nbsp;
firestorm, Colby uploaded another photo of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:32.880
them together on Instagram, writing, quote, "I&nbsp;
love getting to spend time with [Mike Wolfe]."

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:37.280
It definitely seems like she's on Wolfe's good&nbsp;
side, and "American Pickers" fans no doubt hope&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:41.520
she stays there. After the loss of Frank&nbsp;
Fritz, nobody wants to see Colby relegated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:45.920
to the dustbin of history. Here's hoping she's&nbsp;
paid all her taxes by now, otherwise the next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:50.080
vintage outfit she might have to pick out for her&nbsp;
boutique could involve black and white stripes.

